E9 prototype for fuddlesworth/pokebw2 at 41f42ca1afe6291f00b0ba0ec3f6099b9ff1346c: with KALEIDO_SAVE_MAGIC defined, it
replaces the save footers' magic (SAVE_MAGIC, the main save and every extra save) and the outside data's
(SAVE_OUTSIDE_MAGIC, Mystery Gift cards and keys), so a game reads another game's card, Black 2's included, as empty.
Pass it with E3's --define, e.g. --define KALEIDO_SAVE_MAGIC=0x4b4c4431. With it undefined the build matches Black 2.
Modifies GPL-3.0 code, so this patch is GPL-3.0. Recorded for Phase 1 (docs/research/e9-save-identity.md); no build
applies it. It changes ARM9 main's data, so a ROM built with it on needs --allow-stale-secure-area or --arm7-bios.
Check: git apply --check docs/research/e9-save-magic.patch (in a pokebw2 checkout at the commit above).

diff --git a/src/ov331/save_outside.c b/src/ov331/save_outside.c
